---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Us — Aura & Scape | Antima & Shilpa"
  description="Meet Antima & Shilpa, the creative duo behind Aura & Scape. Learn about our journey, philosophy, and passion for creating magical event experiences."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-12 bg-cream" aria-label="About hero">
    <div class="container-site text-center">
      <p class="font-script text-gold text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-3">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-teal-deep mb-4">About Aura & Scape</h1>
      <div class="divider-gold" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="section bg-cream" aria-label="Our story">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="order-2 md:order-1">
          <img
            src="/assets/hero/team.svg"
            alt="Antima and Shilpa, founders of Aura and Scape"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-sm"
            loading="lazy"
            width="600"
            height="750"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-teal-deep mb-4">Two Friends, One Dream</h2>
          <p class="text-forest/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Aura & Scape was born from a simple belief: every celebration should
            feel like a story worth remembering. We're Antima and Shilpa — two
            friends who found their calling in the art of transformation.
          </p>
          <p class="text-forest/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            What started as decorating a friend's intimate gathering grew into a
            shared passion for crafting spaces that don't just look beautiful —
            they make you <em>feel</em> something.
          </p>
          <p class="text-forest/80 leading-relaxed">
            Today, we pour that same care into every event we touch. Whether it's
            a grand wedding or a quiet anniversary, we bring the same energy:
            attention to detail, a love of colour, and a genuine desire to see
            your face when you walk into the space we've created.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="section bg-ivory" aria-label="Our values">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-teal-deep mb-3">What Guides Us</h2>
        <div class="divider-gold" />
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-teal-deep mb-2">Dream First</h3>
          <p class="text-forest/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We start with your vision, not our templates. Your event should feel
            unmistakably yours.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-teal-deep mb-2">Decorate with Heart</h3>
          <p class="text-forest/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Every petal, every light, every drape is placed with intention.
            Nothing is arbitrary. Everything is felt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-teal-deep mb-2">Celebrate Fully</h3>
          <p class="text-forest/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We handle the logistics so you can be fully present in your
            celebration. You live the moment. We guard the details.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Journey -->
  <section class="section bg-cream" aria-label="Our journey">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-teal-deep mb-3">How We Got Here</h2>
        <div class="divider-gold" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative border-l-2 border-gold-light/50 pl-8 space-y-8">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[41px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold border-4 border-cream"></div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-teal-deep">The Spark</h3>
          <p class="text-forest/70 text-sm mt-1">Antima decorated Shilpa's sister's engagement on a tight budget. The photos went viral in their friend group. The next request came that weekend.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[41px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold border-4 border-cream"></div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-teal-deep">Finding Our Voice</h3>
          <p class="text-forest/70 text-sm mt-1">Three wedding seasons in, we realised our style: soft pastels, meaningful touches, and a refusal to copy the "standard" look. Clients started asking for us by name.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[41px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold border-4 border-cream"></div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-teal-deep">Aura & Scape is Born</h3>
          <p class="text-forest/70 text-sm mt-1">We stopped doing favours and started doing this full-time. A name that captures what we do: the <em>aura</em> we create, the <em>scape</em> we build around it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[41px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold-light border-4 border-cream"></div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-teal-deep">Now</h3>
          <p class="text-forest/70 text-sm mt-1">A small team with big ambitions. Every event still gets our full attention. We'd rather do 20 events beautifully than 100 events well-enough.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section bg-blush" aria-label="Contact CTA">
    <div class="container-site text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-teal-deep mb-4">Let's Create Together</h2>
      <p class="text-forest/70 max-w-md mx-auto mb-6">
        Every great event starts with a conversation. Tell us what you're dreaming of.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-teal-deep text-cream font-medium tracking-wide rounded-sm hover:bg-teal-mid transition-colors duration-200"
      >
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .bg-cream { background-color: #FFFDF5; }
  .bg-ivory { background-color: #FDF8F0; }
  .bg-blush { background-color: #F5E6E8; }
  .text-teal-deep { color: #1B4D4A; }
  .text-gold { color: #C9A96E; }
  .text-forest { color: #2C3E3E; }
  .text-forest\/80 { color: rgba(44, 62, 62, 0.8); }
  .text-forest\/70 { color: rgba(44, 62, 62, 0.7); }
  .text-cream { color: #FFFDF5; }
  .bg-teal-deep { background-color: #1B4D4A; }
  .hover\:bg-teal-mid:hover { background-color: #2D6B67; }
  .font-serif { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif; }
  .font-script { font-family: "Great Vibes", cursive; }
  .divider-gold { width: 80px; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #C9A96E, transparent); margin: 1.5rem auto; }
  .container-site { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  .section { padding: 5rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) { .section { padding: 3rem 0; } }
</style>
